d by univariate analyses followed by multivariate modeling.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"in the multivariable model, comparing age ≥65 years versus <65 years, diabetes versus no diabetes, and no doses of vaccination versus 1 dose\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"† Based on 197 cases with known outcomes.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}